<title>NETHERLANDS: Sales of Dutch 2007 bond raise NLG 3.2 bln so far.</title>
<headline>Sales of Dutch 2007 bond raise NLG 3.2 bln so far.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Dutch Finance Ministry said on Wednesday the government had raised 3.2 billion guilders so far through tap sales of its 5.75 percent government bond due February 2007.</p>
<p>Tap sales of the bond, first issued in January, began on Tuesday and will continue daily between 0700 GMT and 1500 GMT until further notice.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
